  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The Kiribati Australia Infrastructure (Te KAI) Program</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The Kiribati Australia Infrastructure (Te KAI) Program is a dedicated small to medium value infrastructure investment. It provides a flexible and responsive mechanism and technical capability to support Australia to manage and deliver quality, inclusive and climate resilient infrastructure development that promotes economic growth in Kiribati.</narrative>
  </description>
